## Switch

```
branches:
  - napi cargo_features=["node"]
  - wasm cargo_features=["wasm"]
```

## build.rs

```rust
fn main() {
    #[cfg(feature = "node")]
    {
        use napi_build;
        napi_build::setup();
    }

    #[cfg(feature = "wasm")]
    {
        use wasm_build;
        wasm_build::setup();
    }
}
```
